304
00:24:04.400 --> 00:24:05.300
Tere tulemast stuudiosse.

305
00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:08.360
See Katrin kulli puur.

306
00:24:08.460 --> 00:24:10.160
Sa oled,
oleksid pidanud tulema siia,

307
00:24:10.260 --> 00:24:13.100
